{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】香港美食嘉年華下周六起於葵涌舉行。</p><p>嘉年華設於葵涌運動場，將設有逾330個攤位，分七大主題，當中三大美食區匯聚80檔熟食攤位，並新增東南亞美食區，更首度引入爆旋陀螺賽事。</p><p>美食嘉年華早上11時至晚上9時開放，入場費6元，並推出多項優惠。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:00:13.400035+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:19:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:17:59.733039+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:46.425046+00:00","content_hash":"6dcb13cc4bc79f5ebe1b759d48619a2c039cb5b9b78684e55c282deda84348fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}